    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/b0335d06abdf30c3c043f3bc075400e9.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Silver Malfeasant and uncover the entity behind freakish, cybernetic-related mutilations. Use your company-issued detective cybernetics and talk to the city's colourful denizens to earn clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your investigative abilities will be tested, and your actions will have consequences. The case's outcome will change based on your choices; which will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/57385da11fcc9390d6f590871a1de7e7.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layered city, where all walks of life dwell. <br>Explore the Undercity and the factions that control its different layers. Be wary of biases and uncover the history between groups or individuals. Is everyone really who they say they are? And what about those that live above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/16c8e3951c75af9a8d7e8506e09ece7a.avif?t=1753918713\" data-has-big width=800 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/332f58574b0802c866ff16053c8c186f.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something lurks out in the dark of night; do you dare face it? The risk might yield something crucial to your investigation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/6fd9e813b370568e06389e1de1b7e41a.poster.avif?t=1753918713\" width=288 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/6fd9e813b370568e06389e1de1b7e41a.webm?t=1753918713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/ab6a53e357f8b810975bd7924123141c.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Full game only)</i> <br>Aid the city's residents in solving their problems to earn extra clues or money to further enhance your detective cybernetics. After all, what use is money when life is on the line?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/b0335d06abdf30c3c043f3bc075400e9.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Silver Malfeasant and uncover the entity behind freakish, cybernetic-related mutilations. Use your company-issued detective cybernetics and talk to the city's colourful denizens to earn clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your investigative abilities will be tested, and your actions will have consequences. The case's outcome will change based on your choices; which will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/57385da11fcc9390d6f590871a1de7e7.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layered city, where all walks of life dwell. <br>Explore the Undercity and the factions that control its different layers. Be wary of biases and uncover the history between groups or individuals. Is everyone really who they say they are? And what about those that live above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/16c8e3951c75af9a8d7e8506e09ece7a.avif?t=1753918713\" data-has-big width=800 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/332f58574b0802c866ff16053c8c186f.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something lurks out in the dark of night; do you dare face it? The risk might yield something crucial to your investigation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/6fd9e813b370568e06389e1de1b7e41a.poster.avif?t=1753918713\" width=288 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/6fd9e813b370568e06389e1de1b7e41a.webm?t=1753918713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/ab6a53e357f8b810975bd7924123141c.avif?t=1753918713\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Full game only)</i> <br>Aid the city's residents in solving their problems to earn extra clues or money to further enhance your detective cybernetics. After all, what use is money when life is on the line?</p>",
    "short_description": "Dystopian corporations puppeteer the apathetic citizens of Silver Tree City. Play as a detective living in the city's underbelly and explore a cyberpunk world of corruption, cover-ups, and catastrophes. Currently in development, everything shown is subject to change.",
